\pard\plain \sl288\slmult1\ltrch\loch {\f1\fs24\b0\i0\cf1 He saw in every stranger\loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\af1\uc1\u8217\'92s face a look of pained reproach, sad and weary,}
\par\plain \f1\fs24\b0\i0\cf1
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0\cf1 He didn\loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\af1\uc1\u8217\'92t like painting older folks. It was a great pity that they were the only ones who could pay. In what kind of world should a young man make a living painting people past their prime, while the beauty of youth disappears from history? It wasn\u8217\'92t right. Wasn\u8217\'92t right at all.}
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0\cf1 He was deeply jealous.}
\par\plain \f1\fs24\b0\i0\cf1
\par\plain \f1\fs24\b0\i0\cf1
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0\cf1 A person is capable of doing incredible things to another person. }
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0\cf1  Every person past a certain age is a walking pit of guilt and shame, or else scarred from people who are. The woman sitting the chair in the corner was well, well past that certain age.}
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0\cf1  The room was dark. Her corner was dark. Her blurry eyes reflected the shine of sunbeams streaming in from the single window. She watched dust motes swirl through the . His entrance had stirred them up. }
\par\plain \f1\fs24\b0\i0\cf1
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0\cf1 Pained reproach.}
\par\plain \f1\fs24\b0\i0\cf1
\par\plain \f1\fs24\b0\i0\cf1
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0\cf1 He\loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\af1\uc1\u8217\'92d been wounded in unexpected ways. He\u8217\'92d failed himself many times. He didn\u8217\'92t feel too bad about it, because everyone had been through worse shit than he had, or was going through it presently, or was about to step in it big time. Unless they were rich. }}